# Issue #3194 (greenfield flag day): the server refuses a sync that extends a
# Loro peer another user owns with 409 `document_sync_peer_owned`. Every
# document mutation code enum shares the sync codes, so each operation that
# advertises them gains the value. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as
# main contains the new contract.
POST /containers added the new `document_sync_peer_owned` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`

# Issue #3194: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /containers/with-metadata-document added the new `document_sync_peer_owned` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`

